  (x + 32 <= F \/ F + 256 <= x) /\ (x / 8 + SB + 4 <= F / 8 + SB \/ F / 8 + SB + 32 <= x / 8 + SB) /\ (x + 32 <= fl \/ fl + 1 <= x).
